[{"type": "chat", "time": 2760.553, "timestamp": "00:46:00", "author": "@Solaralt-k8h", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lA7jr0LZvBQFLmBc7jijnVjyoazsJEdCveoYk4bFvSLqy3mJRIVzhAwp7IKIkTOUTl9A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and look where it got you!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2761.109, "timestamp": "00:46:01", "text": "我最初最想做的就是成為音樂家和直播主播。其次，我想說，我看到其他創意人士創作作品等等，從中獲得了靈感"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2763.993, "timestamp": "00:46:03", "author": "@Solaralt-k8h", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lA7jr0LZvBQFLmBc7jijnVjyoazsJEdCveoYk4bFvSLqy3mJRIVzhAwp7IKIkTOUTl9A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Famous!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2764.069, "timestamp": "00:46:04", "text": "。  我當時就想，我也想做點類似的事情，看看效果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2790.15, "timestamp": "00:46:30", "text": "如何。  是的，我就是這樣開始的。  其實，我主要是想嘗試一些東西，弄清楚自己的問題。  我有很多嗜好。  我當時就想，我想嘗試追逐我的夢想和嗜好。  所以，是的，只要我玩得開心，一切都好。  如果我覺得不好玩，那"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2810.571, "timestamp": "00:46:50", "author": "@Solaralt-k8h", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lA7jr0LZvBQFLmBc7jijnVjyoazsJEdCveoYk4bFvSLqy3mJRIVzhAwp7IKIkTOUTl9A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Yes you are"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2817.077, "timestamp": "00:46:57", "author": "@Solaralt-k8h", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lA7jr0LZvBQFLmBc7jijnVjyoazsJEdCveoYk4bFvSLqy3mJRIVzhAwp7IKIkTOUTl9A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "YES YOU ARE"}]